      "description": "Jeffrey Epstein was a convicted sex offender and financier who was arrested in 2019 and died in custody in 2019 under controversial circumstances. The meme references his alleged survival as a false or conspiratorial claim, implying that former President Bill Clinton may be responsible or complicit. This requires external knowledge of Epstein’s crimes, his arrest, and his death to understand the meme’s accusatory intent.",
